<td id="fileinfotpl_desc" class="fileinfo-paramfield" lang="en">Description<span class="summary fn" style="display:none">Racknitz - The Turk 3.jpg</span></td>
<td class="description">
From book that tried to explain the illusions behind the Kempelen chess playing automaton (known as <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/the_Turk" class="extiw" title="w:the Turk">The Turk</a>) after making reconstructions of the device.</td>
</tr>

